AB  - “Smyrida” is a modular software system in the form of a web application with open APIs making it adaptive to new techniques that can be applied for process mining and capable of being integrated to information systems producing event logs. From the user perspective, there is the need for providing interactive intuitive visualization capabilities, and allowing users without advanced process mining skills to extract process models and evaluate their business processes. © 2023 The Author(s)
