AB  - Ebi is an open-source framework for stochastic process mining. Ebi currently contains over 30 techniques related to stochastic process mining, from completeness estimation to analysis, conformance checking, discovery, visualisation and statistical tests, and can be called from the command line. For technique developers, Ebi allows abstractions on inputs through interfaces (“traits”), such that implemented techniques automatically support a variety of input and output types. Furthermore, Ebi almost completely uses exact arithmetic to avoid precision issues with low values. © 2024 Copyright for this paper by its authors.
