AB  - In this paper, we have on the development and implementation of blockchain algorithm using Verilog. Currently, the blockchain process (mining) is performed using high-powered GPUs and CPUs which consumes a lot of energy and produces enormous amount of green house gasses which can harm the environment. We have implemented the blockchain algorithm using Verilog and have performed the simulations which have provided the accurate output. The simulations are performed using Modelsim and Xilinx ISE Design Suite Software. Since, we got the desired results of the verilog simulation, as a next step, we will focus on the design of the ASIC Chip which will be capable of performing the blockchain mining process. Thus, instead of bulky apparatus like GPUs, only a small ASIC Chip will be needed to perform blockchain mining.. © 2023, The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Singapore Pte Ltd.
