TI  - A Path Forward for Automation in Robotic Process Automation Projects: Potential Process Selection Strategies
PY  - 2022
T2  - 2022 International Conference on Machine Learning, Big Data, Cloud and Parallel Computing, COM-IT-CON 2022
SP  - 801
EP  - 805
