AB  - The paper presents simulation tools for investigation not only the structural characteristics of social networks in order to study information dissemination strategies, but also the dynamic characteristics of this process. A feature of this software system is not only the ability to work with virtual social networks, but also with data from real networks. To collect data about a real social network, a special software agent has been developed. An ontological approach is used to store data about real network. © 2021, Springer Nature Switzerland AG.
