AB  - Data preprocessing frequently consumes a large proportion of the time spent on process mining projects. Although several commercial process mining software solutions offer data preparation scripts, these typically cover only a narrow set of process perspectives and source systems. When a particular perspective or system is not supported, practitioners usually need to fall back on ad-hoc ETL solutions. This paper introduces Konekti: a tool dedicated to offering a structured approach to prepare event data for process mining. © 2022 Copyright for this paper by its authors.
