TI  - Mining encrypted software logs using alpha algorithm
PY  - 2017
T2  - ICETE 2017 - Proceedings of the 14th International Joint Conference on e-Business and Telecommunications
VL  - 4
SP  - 267
EP  - 274
DO  - 10.5220/0006408602670274
