TI  - Have we seen enough traces?
PY  - 2016
T2  - Proceedings - 2015 30th IEEE/ACM International Conference on Automated Software Engineering, ASE 2015
C7  - 7371999
SP  - 93
EP  - 103
DO  - 10.1109/ASE.2015.62
