TI  - Business process configuration in the cloud: How to support and analyze multi-tenant processes?
PY  - 2011
T2  - Proceedings - 9th IEEE European Conference on Web Services, ECOWS 2011
C7  - 6061094
SP  - 3
EP  - 10
DO  - 10.1109/ECOWS.2011.8
